seg-200e59d9279c = The binary frame is Kshana's own documented encoding modelled on these components, not any system's bit layout. RINEX { "4.02" } defines no LEO navigation records, so the RINEX-style export is a documented Kshana extension (prior art: <a1>arXiv { "2401.17767" }</a1>).

